WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.020
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:13.730
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:13.740
Mountains are calling
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.280
Mountains are calling

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:20.240
The sky is calling

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:27.750
Something awaits you in the distance

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:34.130
So brightly     the blood burns

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.260
You understand why you were born

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:44.600
Run and Run!

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:46.560
Run and Run!

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:50.140
Become the wind, and run

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:56.860
Go on, you're going to surpass the yesterdays you

00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:04.660
You will stand up to yourself     to greater things

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:07.870
That's right!     It is young

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:14.880
It doesn't burn out     A shooting star

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:23.510
<i>In the blizzard of Twin Pass...</i>

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:27.010
<i>Their long-cherished wish to overthrow
Akakabuto, has finally come.</i>

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:38.270
<i>Males from the north, from the south,
gathered from all over the country.</i>

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:42.480
<i>In the name of their oath,
they were about to face the final battle.</i>

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:46.780
<i>Behold! The males death-defying bravery!</i>

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:51.280
<i>Only their arch enemy
Akakabuto is remaining.</i>

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:59.550
SILVER<i>!</i>
TOWARDS A NEW JOURNEY AS A MALE<i>!!</i>

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:01.330
All males, attack!

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:14.850
Ben! You're too injured to fight!

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.940
Silver, don't stop me!
Let me be male!

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:26.980
Ben, Retreat!

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:28.820
Leader, please forgive me!

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.820
Ben, you will die!

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:33.820
Can't you hear my command?
Ben!

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:39.320
<i>Ben knew that the leader's harsh
orders were of compassion.</i>

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:43.420
<i>But that only increased his fighting spirit.</i>

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:46.690
Ben!

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.760
Leave Akakabuto to us!

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:53.260
<i>Leader... and my friends...
Goodbye!</i>

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:58.030
<i>I'm going to die anyway. Give me the
honor of helping you to victory!</i>

00:02:58.440 --> 00:02:59.610
Ah... Look out!

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:06.570
Watch it!
Rocks are falling!

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:08.940
Spread out!
Jump from side to side!

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:20.440
Damn... What a a son of a bitch!

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:23.830
Don't hesitate!

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:27.170
He can't destroy the wall any more.
Advance!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:28.970
Ah... What about Ben?

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:30.720
Ben is gone!

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.720
Oh, over there!

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:44.150
Look at that...
That's your father.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.410
What makes you a true male?

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:50.910
Burn this image into your eyes.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:00.530
The first one is...
Is me, Ben!

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:07.420
Cross...
Now I can call myself a proud father!

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:11.670
Ben!

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.810
Ben, let go! Release your fangs!

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:19.760
Leader... Your special attack...
It's the only thing that can beat him!

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:31.940
<i>Ben wanted to be a decoy,
for The Leader's attack to succeed.</i>

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:35.830
<i>That's why he launched a reckless attack.</i>

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.550
Leader!
Please do it!

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:40.870
Hurry!

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:42.870
I understand, Ben!

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:44.120
I'm going now!

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:47.450
<i>The only way to save Ben was to
defeat Akakabuto. The leader jumped.</i>

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:50.670
<i>Suddenly... a light that exceeds
The Leader's speed, appeared.</i>

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:51.360
<i>It was silver.</i>

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:51.640
Silver... How admirably done!
<i>It was silver.</i>

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:53.340
Silver... How admirably done!

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:54.390
No...

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:57.560
No matter how fast you go,
frontal attacks are suicide!

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:01.560
Silver, he is right-handed!
A right will come first!

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:03.560
Rotate and direct
your feet sideways!

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:04.610
Okay!

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:09.580
What?
What?
What?

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.750
Ben, it's dangerous!
Get away fast!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:33.640
Scatter!

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:34.850
He'll crush you!

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:50.890
Ben!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.700
Silver, nicely done!

00:05:57.870 --> 00:05:58.450
Ben!

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:02.410
Ben!

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.300
Cover Silver!

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:20.880
You'll never kill Ben!

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:28.320
What?

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:30.770
He dodged it!

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:34.770
That giant actually dodged
the special attack!

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:37.360
What agility!
Same attack won't work twice.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.200
<i>Akakabuto was stubbornly
aiming for Silver and Ben.</i>

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:50.440
<i>He was furious at having been
wounded and thrown out of his fortress.</i>

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:51.710
Protect Ben!

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:17.110
Akatora!

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:20.490
Damn it!

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.000
Come, if you dare!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.000
Silver, leave him to me!

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:27.060
Akatora...

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.710
Ben saved us brothers!

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:33.500
I'll protect him,
even if it costs me my life!

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:34.960
Stop it, Akatora!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:36.340
You can't with that injury!

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:40.140
Akatora of Kai does
not die so easily!

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:45.980
With one eye gone, there is only
one way to repay you my debt!

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:47.050
Big Brother!

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:54.450
Big Brother!
Big Brother!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:04.500
Crap!

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:17.760
He did it!

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:17.850
Big Brother!
He did it!

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:18.760
Big Brother!

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:20.050
Akatora...

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.400
Big Brother!
Hold on!

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.360
Akatora...

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.370
Red snow...?

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.130
Suitable for my funeral...

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.590
Akatora!

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:54.930
Big Brother!

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:55.970
Do not die!

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:56.550
Big Brother!
Do not die!

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:57.010
Big Brother!

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.300
Akatora is dead!

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:09.300
Akatora is...?

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.800
Akatora was killed!

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:13.300
I can't forgive you
anymore, Akakabuto!

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:19.950
Akakabuto have lost his left eye...

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:21.440
...and is blind!

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.660
Do not let Akatora's death be in vain!

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:25.370
How dare you kill Akatora!

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:26.500
I can't forgive this!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:26.540
Big Brother's killer!
I can't forgive this!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:27.400
Big Brother's killer!

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:37.010
<i>Silver's anger exploded at the loss
of his long time friend, Akatora.</i>

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:41.790
<i>Chutora, Kurotora and all males...</i>

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:45.790
<i>...forgot the fear of Akakabuto and
attacked him as a unified group.</i>

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:51.980
That roar is...?

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:55.560
Do not hesitate! He is blind!
There's nothing to be afraid of!

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:00.310
Okay! Everyone, attack!

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.530
That howl is Riki's...
You didn't die, did you?

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.430
Silver! You are here as well?

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.600
Smith, did you bring him?

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:37.990
Yes! I don't want anymore
of my friends to die.

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.850
I thought that the old man
could finish off Akakabuto.

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:47.980
Hey, you bastard Akakabuto!
Akatora's enemy!

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:51.990
Now you will face Moss, the monster
from the Misty Mountains!

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:05.920
He's gonna fall!

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:10.720
Now! Aim for the stomach!

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:21.070
What a tough son of a bitch!
Get him!

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:42.700
What a horrible bear! How can he
fight so skillfully, with no eyesight?

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:47.540
If you don't sacrifice yourself like Big Brother,
then you won't be able to beat him?

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:52.630
<i>The evil Akakabuto had
a frighteningly delicate sense of smell...</i>

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:55.140
<i>...and he could accurately read
the dog's movements.</i>

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:57.970
Silver, follow me!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.810
If we attack from the downwind,
his sense of smell will be useless.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.980
John, The Leader and Silver
is running behind him!

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:08.230
Then we will get his attention!

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:16.320
Silver, listen carefully. Do you know
why we are called "Bear dogs"?

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:21.580
Because there is an instinct for a special move
that has been in our blood for generations.

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:22.750
Special move?

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:26.630
Now, I'll teach you
that move, my son!

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:29.430
Leader... what did you say...?

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:30.720
My son!

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.930
A bears greatest weapon
is the front paw claws.

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:37.930
The only way to seal it is to
attack a point near his spine.

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:39.640
Father...

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:43.680
<i>The Leader could not
sacrifice any more males.</i>

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:48.520
<i>He decided that he had no choice
but to use his last great attack move.</i>

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:51.950
Hurry up!
There is a limit to what we can do!

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:53.620
Son, observe...

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:54.950
Our special attack...

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:55.750
...the secret

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:56.880
("The Cutting Fang of the Heavenly Wolf")

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:57.540
Zetsu Tenrô Battôga
("The Cutting Fang of the Heavenly Wolf")

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:58.080
Zetsu Tenrô Battôga

00:12:58.080 --> 00:12:58.840
Yes, father!
Zetsu Tenrô Battôga

00:12:58.840 --> 00:12:59.130
Yes, father!

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:18.890
As expected, he is called
"The Demon King" after all.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.390
I can't cut it all at once.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.140
Silver, follow up!

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:24.860
Increase the power of
your fangs by spinning!

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:30.480
Now!

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:59.020
Silver, well done!

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:00.220
Father!

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:01.640
We did it!

00:14:01.680 --> 00:14:02.680
We defeated Akakabuto!

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:04.730
Big Brother, we took him down!

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:11.990
What's this!

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:21.840
His spinal muscles are torn,
and still... he stands up!

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:24.050
Silver! Riki! Stay back!

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:25.960
I'll finish him!

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:29.510
Damn you Akakabuto!
Do you know who I am?

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:36.760
Don't say you've forgotten me!

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:46.770
That sound was...?

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:48.610
It was grandfather's gun!

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:49.440
Hurry up!

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:33.150
<i>Six and a half years Akakabuto
terrorized the Twin Pass.</i>

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.940
<i>But now it was finally over.</i>

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:39.440
<i>Shiro, Riki and Silver...
Three generations of struggle...</i>

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:44.780
<i>...and the old man Gohei's revenge,
had finally been accomplished.</i>

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:48.740
It's over. Finally it's over.

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:56.710
Riki, Silver, well done!
That was brilliant.

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:04.720
<i>It was sudden and unexpected...</i>

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:11.480
<i>...Akakabuto that was supposed to
be dead, just came back.</i>

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:14.980
<i>It was the insane
obsession of a demon.</i>

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:17.980
You son of a bitch!

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.090
Father!

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:36.590
Riki!

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:50.600
Damn you Akakabuto!

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:53.860
Look at this! The secret attack
my father taught me!

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:56.190
Silver...

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:04.530
Silver killed him!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:05.490
Beautifull!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:12.750
Riki!

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:16.170
Father!

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:19.510
Silver... beautifully done.

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:20.670
I saw everything.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:21.670
Father!

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:24.420
Leader! Please hold on!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.140
(All) Leader!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:31.430
Silver, as of today, you are
The Leader of Twin Pass.

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:33.600
Ben, I'm counting on you.

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:36.280
Don't worry, Leader.

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.600
You all have no objections, right?

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:39.820
(All) No!

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:45.570
Father...

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.080
S..Silver...

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:53.330
It's me, Daisuke!

00:17:57.420 --> 00:17:58.170
Silver...

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:02.670
It's me, Daisuke!

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:06.800
What's up? Silver is our...!

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:08.300
Stop, Daisuke!

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.800
Silver is not
the same dog anymore.

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:18.440
I'll tell to everyone that this
Twin Pass belongs to Silver now.

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:24.940
Silver gathered everyone together
and defeated Akakabuto.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.990
We weren't able to do it.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:31.030
Yes, we weren't able
to do anything to Akakabuto.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:32.630
Couldn't do anything...?

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.300
You didn't try enough!

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:40.340
Silver and his friends have
something that we have lost...

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.590
...that's courage!

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:46.090
These dogs are real men!

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.350
Let's go.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:00.100
Grandfather, should you
really leave Riki here?

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:04.360
We must take care of his wounds?

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:06.360
It's already too late for Riki.

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:11.860
A great man does not want
an audience when he dies.

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:22.880
Silver... you were amazing!

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:26.550
Silv...

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:31.250
I get it...

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:34.220
Silver, come play
with me once in a while.

00:19:37.010 --> 00:19:41.190
The door is always open for you!

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:47.400
Silver... Don't forget
that we are real friends!

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:54.950
John and everyone,
take good care of silver!

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:55.700
See you!

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:04.010
My son...

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.970
...you should not grieve.

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:09.350
You have won!

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:10.460
Celebrate it!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:17.500
Howl to honor the dead and
celebrate with the survivors.

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:21.770
Well then... my son...

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:24.530
Understood, Father!

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:26.910
My friends!

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.030
We have

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:28.530
Won!
We have

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:28.740
Won!

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:29.580
Won!
Won!

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:29.830
Won!

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:55.220
Leader...

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:13.520
<i>The males have won.</i>

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:17.950
<i>United in hundreds, they succeeded
after a heroic battle...</i>

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:21.700
<i>...they finally defeated
the mighty enemy Akakabuto.</i>

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:23.210
<i>It was...</i>

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:26.510
<i>...a victory with friendship,
effort and courage.</i>

00:22:32.820 --> 00:22:37.820
<i>And now a new Leader has
been born on behalf of Riki.</i>

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:41.320
<i>The small Colossus:
The Shooting Star - Silver.</i>

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:48.070
<i>He radiates joy of youth,
that has endured difficult trials.</i>

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:52.320
<i>He was shining with courage and
confidence without fear of anything.</i>

00:22:53.550 --> 00:23:00.690
<b>The End</b>

00:23:14.780 --> 00:23:20.030
When a shower of a moonlight

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:26.160
bathes you gently

00:23:27.260 --> 00:23:32.300
Say goodbye to pain and

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:40.860
let it flow away

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:46.860
For he who lives today with all his heart

00:23:47.160 --> 00:23:53.490
a better tomorrow will surely come

00:23:53.830 --> 00:23:59.670
TOMORROW, let us run again

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:05.550
TOMORROW, lets shine brightly
